# Optional. Without it the app works fully; the "Ask AI" button is simply not shown.
# With it, the server can ask Claude about columns the rules could not identify.
# Copy this file to .env.local (which git ignores) and fill it in. Never commit a real key.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. The model used for the suggestion. Defaults to claude-opus-5-5.
# claude-haiku-5-5 is far cheaper and is usually enough for this small task.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5
